Off-Axis Spins,FS Cork 1080,,1080,Double Black,4.0,FS Cork 900,Double cork,Jump,"1080-degree frontside off-axis spin. At takeoff the torso is tipped uphill of the feet, so the rotation leaves the vertical axis and the board passes overhead. Control the axis through the rotation and bring the board back level for the landing.",,,
Off-Axis Spins,FS Cork 720,,720,Double Black,4.0,FS Cork 540,FS Cork 900,Jump,"720-degree frontside off-axis spin. At takeoff the torso is tipped uphill of the feet, so the rotation leaves the vertical axis and the board passes overhead. Control the axis through the rotation and bring the board back level for the landing.",,,
Off-Axis Spins,FS Cork 900,,900,Double Black,4.0,FS Cork 720,FS Cork 1080,Jump,"900-degree frontside off-axis spin. At takeoff the torso is tipped uphill of the feet, so the rotation leaves the vertical axis and the board passes overhead. Control the axis through the rotation and bring the board back level for the landing.",,,
Off-Axis Spins,FS Rodeo 1080,,1080,Double Black,4.0,FS Rodeo 900,Double cork,Jump,"1080-degree frontside off-axis spin. At takeoff the torso drops downhill of the feet, sending the rider backwards over the nose into the off-axis rotation. Control the axis through the rotation and bring the board back level for the landing.",,,
Off-Axis Spins,FS Rodeo 720,,720,Double Black,4.0,FS Rodeo 540,FS Rodeo 900,Jump,"720-degree frontside off-axis spin. At takeoff the torso drops downhill of the feet, sending the rider backwards over the nose into the off-axis rotation. Control the axis through the rotation and bring the board back level for the landing.",,,
Off-Axis Spins,FS Rodeo 900,,900,Double Black,4.0,FS Rodeo 720,FS Rodeo 1080,Jump,"900-degree frontside off-axis spin. At takeoff the torso drops downhill of the feet, sending the rider backwards over the nose into the off-axis rotation. Control the axis through the rotation and bring the board back level for the landing.",,,
